      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Para entender lo cruel que era esa orden, hay que saber qué significan las ofrendas en Bali.",
          "en": "To understand how cruel this order was, you need to know what offerings mean in Bali."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cada día, las familias hacen bandejitas de hoja de palma con flores y arroz, llamadas canang sari.",
          "en": "Every day, families make small trays of palm leaf with flowers and rice, called canang sari."
        },
        {
          "es": "Las dejan en altares, puertas y cruces de caminos, como agradecimiento y como regalo.",
          "en": "They place them at shrines, doorways and crossroads, as thanks and as gifts."
        },
        {
          "es": "Las ofrendas equilibran a los dioses de arriba y a los espíritus dañinos de abajo. Sin ellas, ese equilibrio se rompe.",
          "en": "Offerings keep the balance between the gods above and the harmful spirits below. Without them, that balance breaks."
        }
      ],
