      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Pronto toda la isla empezó a sufrir.",
          "en": "Soon the whole island began to suffer."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los arrozales se secaron y la cosecha se perdió.",
          "en": "The rice fields dried up, and the harvest failed."
        },
        {
          "es": "La enfermedad pasó de aldea en aldea, y la gente tenía demasiado miedo para rezar, incluso a escondidas.",
          "en": "Sickness spread from village to village, and people were too afraid to pray, even in secret."
